{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7uzchh2d","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":25,"title":"So wohne ich","nativeTitle":"This Is How I Live","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Lisa","Nico"],"speakerGenders":{"Lisa":"female","Nico":"male"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Nico?","native":"Nico?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Hmm?","native":"Hmm?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Wir haben ein Problem.","native":"We have a problem."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ein Problem?","native":"A problem?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja, ein Problem. Du kannst nur noch zwei Tage in der WG bleiben. Dann musst du umziehen . Verstehst du?","native":"Yes, a problem. You can only stay in the shared apartment for two more days. Then you have to move out. Do you understand?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Okay. Kein Problem.","native":"Okay. No problem."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Unsere Heizung ist kaputt . Sebastian, Nina, Nawin und ich fahren dann in Urlaub .","native":"Our heating is broken. Sebastian, Nina, Nawin and I are going on vacation then."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Du bist nicht da? Ich suche mir ein Hotel.","native":"You won't be here? I'll find myself a hotel."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Nein. Das ist sehr teuer. Eine Jugendherberge ist besser .","native":"No. That's very expensive. A youth hostel is better."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Jugendherberge?","native":"Youth hostel?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja. Eine Jugendherberge oder ein Hostel . Jugendherbergen und Hostels sind nicht so teuer wie ein Hotel. Viele junge Leute übernachten dort. Und ich frag meine Freunde und Bekannten . Vielleicht haben sie ein Zimmer frei .","native":"Yes. A youth hostel or a hostel. Youth hostels and hostels aren't as expensive as a hotel. Many young people stay there. And I'll ask my friends and acquaintances. Maybe they have a room available."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Okay, danke.","nativ